 "thesis": {
  "available": true,
  "why_on_the_list": "Compounder bucket, rank 63. Subscription revenue growing 24.5%, forward P/E 29 vs a 123 median, 42% off its high. Still the most expensive name on the shortlist on earnings.",
  "business_quality": "Platform moat inside the enterprise: once workflows are built on it they rarely leave. ServiceNow AI passed $1 billion of annual contract value with agentic deployments up ninefold in nine months. Margins are under some pressure from AI compute costs.",
