  "conviction": 3,
  "logged": null,
  "source": "hand-written research note in research/"
 },
 "risks": {
  "available": true,
  "bear_case": "Agents that live in the model layer make the workflow layer a commodity: why route a ticket through ServiceNow when the assistant resolves it? Seat based pricing shrinks as agents replace people. Margins are already compressing from AI costs, and at 29x there is no valuation cushion if growth slips to the teens.",
